.TH CHTTP_DO 3 "2026-07-10" "c_collections" "C Collections Library - Functions"
.SH NAME
chttp_do_default \- do an HTTP request with the default client
.SH LIBRARY
C Collections (libccollections, \-lccollections)
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
#include <ccollections/chttpclient.h>

ccol_retval chttp_do_default(const chttp_request *req,
                       chttpcli_response **resp_out);
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
.nf
This function is the same as
chttpcli_do(chttp_default_client(), req, resp_out).
.fi
.SH RETURN VALUE
.nf
The same codes as chttpcli_do, or ccol_unexpected_failure when the
default client cannot be initialized.
.fi
.SH "SEE ALSO"
.BR chttpcli_do (3),
.BR chttp_default_client (3)
